OL,3,AAndrew received up to #2,000 per month
OL,4,Afrom sub-letting, watchdog reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor was
OL,7,Freceiving up to #2,000 per month for
OL,8,Fsub-letting three cottages at his
OL,9,Fformer home at Royal Lodge, when he
OL,10,Fdidn't have to pay any rent himself,
OL,11,Faccording to the public spending
OL,12,Fwatchdog.
OL,14,FThe Public Accounts Committee inquiry
OL,15,Finto the Crown Estate says the former
OL,16,FPrince Andrew did not always rent out
OL,17,Fall the properties, so it cannot say
OL,18,Fhow much the total might have been over
OL,19,Fmore than 20 years of his time there.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
