OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAndrew received up to #2,000 per month
OL,4,Afrom sub-letting, watchdog reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sub-letting income went to
OL,7,FMountbatten-Windsor, rather than his
OL,8,Flandlord the Crown Estate.
OL,10,FMPs on the committee have recommended
OL,11,Fthat in future such leases should
OL,12,Fprohibit sub-letting, unless
OL,13,Fspecifically agreed with the landlord.
